  <item>
    <title>Vol.105 东北是数字游民和养老的选择吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f1fde86fa9c45987e254c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f1fde86fa9c45987e254c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾老马对沈阳口音、大连回忆和洗浴文化聊得头头是道。东北真是只有大碴子味儿吗？冷面之争谁赢了？烧烤配搓澡才正宗？一起听听他眼里的东北真相。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 北京望京的韩国烤肉店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 大连、沈阳和长春的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a> 让你感受家的味道，东北菜的魅力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> 北京城烟火气息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> 东北社会的年轻人的抉择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a> 人气、医疗条件与自然环境的考量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a> 离开北京后的心境变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> 城市化趋势逆转：城市恢复自然状态？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65abc19da310a0e29e101474/lht3XC0_i5Y3mBwmeMmiqSpuws7s.m4a" length="61820985" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbcObMUenxU0mbcN3j3NV2pIiSS.png"/>
